<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>parasite</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">MICO, Haiden Henderson</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">tension (heightened)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6t035pK4cNtYgfckRDmDfd</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.128" end="00:08.440">I swear to god, I have a type</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.440" end="00:11.674">I should've took it as a warning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.674" end="00:14.955">Read through our texts as you ignore me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.955" end="00:18.550">I'm hooked on every line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.550" end="00:21.721">I don't remember what I'm like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.721" end="00:25.002">There's something sinister controling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.002" end="00:28.017">I hold my breath until you hold me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.017" end="00:31.018">Yeah, you make me feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.018" end="00:34.313">Ooh, now I can't get you off my tongue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.313" end="00:37.533">The way you're moving gets my body feeling numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.533" end="00:40.844">And every time we try to talk, you shut me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.844" end="00:44.658">I know there's nothing left to say, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.658" end="00:47.362">I know it from the look in your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.362" end="00:51.377">You'll only lovе me 'til the end of thе night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.377" end="00:55.350">I'll give you what you need 'til I'm lying on the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.350" end="00:58.132">Got me paralyzed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.132" end="01:00.959">We're dancing on the edge of a knife</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.959" end="01:04.646">I'd let you twist it in to say that you're mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.646" end="01:08.623">I love the way it feels when I'm dying for your love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.623" end="01:11.561">Like a parasite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.561" end="01:15.252">And when you kiss another guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.252" end="01:18.549">Is that subliminally for me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.549" end="01:21.595">His arms around you in the morning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.595" end="01:25.330">But hoping they were mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.330" end="01:29.346">You had me thinking I was falling for you, now I fall in line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.346" end="01:32.846">You made it look so easy, let a good thing die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.846" end="01:34.751">Said you wished you were mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.751" end="01:36.424">Picked every dandelion</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.424" end="01:38.580">Bet he doesn't have a clue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.580" end="01:40.783">That I can't get you off my tongue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.783" end="01:44.112">Don't wanna call it quits, I'd rather call it dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.112" end="01:47.377">And every time I try to talk, you shut me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.377" end="01:51.487">But there's just so much left to say, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.487" end="01:54.283">I know it from the look in your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.283" end="01:58.080">You'll only love me 'til the end of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.080" end="02:02.045">I'll give you what you need 'til I'm lying on the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.045" end="02:04.499">Got me paralyzed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.499" end="02:07.717">We're dancing on the edge of a knife</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.717" end="02:11.186">I'd let you twist it in to say that you're mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.186" end="02:15.422">I love the way it feels when I'm dying for your love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.422" end="02:19.406">Like a parasite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.406" end="02:22.928">You hold me all night, ignore me all day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.928" end="02:26.178">You hate when I leave, but you don't wanna stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.178" end="02:29.460">I know it's not right, I know you won't change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.460" end="02:33.053">Either way, either way, either way, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.053" end="02:36.256">You call me all night, ignore me all day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.256" end="02:39.772">You hate when I leave, but you don't wanna stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.772" end="02:43.022">I know it's not right, I know you won't change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.022" end="02:44.522">Either way, either way, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.506" end="02:47.729">I should've known it from the look in your eyes (Eyes)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.729" end="02:51.243">You'll only love me 'til the end of the night (Night)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.243" end="02:55.306">I'll give you what you need 'til I'm lying on the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.306" end="02:57.852">Got me paralyzed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.852" end="03:00.868">We're dancing on the edge of a knife</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.868" end="03:04.618">I'd let you twist it in to say that you're mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.618" end="03:08.431">I love the way it feels when I'm dying for your love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.431" end="03:12.431">Like a parasite</p></div></body></tt>